				"Forming the multiblock only needs the &b&lFilter Casing"
				"The extension module controller only recognises the 8 functional blocks around itself"
				""
				"Note: if you use the Circuit Assembly Line mode, while using a Pattern Hatch you must clear the recipe cache at the same time as you change the robot (take the pattern out and put it back, break the Pattern Hatch and place it again, etc.), otherwise after the change the Pattern Hatch will not recognise the new robot and crafting will fail"
				""
				"In JEI's multiblock structure preview screen, clicking \"M\" shows the multiblock structure with &eall modules installed&r"
				""
				"The specific installation diagram can be seen on the next page"
